# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository for all text files.
# Prevents CRLF from Windows checkouts leaking into committed source —
# important for files parsed by tooling sensitive to line endings
# (e.g. MDX/Docusaurus code fences) and for the GitLab->GitHub mirror.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
